<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Reliance started by Everen.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Reliance started by Everen.</headline>
<text>
<p>--Everen Securities analyst Steve Huffines said he started coverage of Reliance Group Holdings Inc with a market performer-outperform rating.</p>
<p>--Shares in the insurer closed up 1/8 at 11-1/4 Thursday.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
